Package: mysql-change-database-encoding
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: database
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: ruby (>= 1:2.7), ruby-mysql2, ruby-activerecord
Maintainer: Durable Programming LLC <commercial@durableprogramming.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/durableprogramming/mysql_change_database_encoding
Description: Tool for changing a database's encoding, collation, or both
 Tool for changing a database's encoding, collation, or both. Supports online 
 schema change via pt-online-schema-change with configurable fallback.
 .
 This tool can be used to migrate MySQL databases from legacy encodings
 like latin1 to modern UTF-8 encodings like utf8mb4, with support for
 online schema changes to minimize downtime.